%% Outbox Pattern - Local-First Sync Architecture
%% Shows the complete data flow from user action to server synchronization

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as 👤 User
    participant UI as 🎨 Blazor UI
    participant LocalSvc as 📱 LocalFirstBoardDataService
    participant SQLite as 🗃️ SQLite
    participant Outbox as 📤 Outbox Queue
    participant Sync as 🔄 SyncCoordinator
    participant API as 🔌 Server API
    participant PG as 🐘 PostgreSQL

    Note over User,PG: Create New Habit Flow

    User->>UI: Create Habit "Exercise"
    UI->>LocalSvc: CreateAsync(dto)
    
    LocalSvc->>SQLite: INSERT BoardItems
    LocalSvc->>Outbox: INSERT OutboxOperation<br/>(Kind: Create, Payload: {...})
    LocalSvc->>UI: Return CreatedItem
    UI->>User: Show Success
    
    Note right of Sync: Background Sync Loop
    
    Sync->>Outbox: TryDrainOneOutboxOperationAsync()
    Outbox-->>Sync: OutboxOperation
    
    Sync->>API: POST /api/board/habits<br/>(with IdempotencyKey)
    API->>PG: INSERT BoardItem
    API-->>Sync: 200 OK (ServerItem with new ID)
    
    Sync->>SQLite: UPDATE BoardItems<br/>SET ServerId = {newId}
    Sync->>SQLite: DELETE OutboxOperation
    
    Note over Sync,API: Exponential Backoff on Failure
    
    alt Network Error
        API--xSync: 500 Error / Timeout
        Sync->>Sync: Backoff(attempt) = 2^attempt seconds<br/>Max: 300 seconds
        Sync->>Sync: Schedule retry
    else Conflict Detected (409)
        API-->>Sync: 409 Conflict<br/>(Server has newer version)
        Sync->>SQLite: Mark for manual review
    end

    Note over User,PG: Update Flow with Coalescing
    
    User->>UI: Edit Habit Title
    UI->>LocalSvc: UpdateAsync(dto)
    LocalSvc->>SQLite: UPDATE BoardItems
    LocalSvc->>Outbox: INSERT OutboxOperation<br/>(Kind: Update)
    
    User->>UI: Delete Habit (immediately after create)
    UI->>LocalSvc: DeleteAsync(id)
    
    LocalSvc->>Outbox: Check for pending Create
    Outbox-->>LocalSvc: Found pending Create
    LocalSvc->>SQLite: DELETE Outbox (Create operation)
    LocalSvc->>SQLite: DELETE BoardItems (local entity)
    Note right of LocalSvc: Coalesced! No server call needed

    Note over User,PG: Conflict Resolution Flow
    
    Sync->>API: Update with ExpectedUpdatedAtUtc
    API->>PG: Check current UpdatedAt
    alt Timestamp Match
        PG->>PG: Apply update
        API-->>Sync: 200 OK
    else Timestamp Mismatch
        API-->>Sync: 409 Conflict
        Sync->>SQLite: Store conflict for resolution
        Sync->>Sync: Stop auto-sync, notify user
    end
